# QA M4 (was bug_m4_checkpoint_hold_left, fixed in the level): game-design.md
# Stage 5 says "A Resi respawning at 150 who holds LEFT walks onto open
# road: no pit, no bus". The st_wolfgang_solver route to 1290 (past the
# checkpoint), a little LEFT into the Markt globe lane, where a globe kills
# her (death 1411), the respawn at the checkpoint, then 300 frames of LEFT:
# she walks to the screen's left edge (x 2264; the camera never scrolls
# back) on the open road and stays alive. Fixed by penning Selfie-Tourist #3
# at the Markt entrance (153-162, between a bench at 152 and the fountain
# basin; he used to be reset at 146 and walk into her). Bus #2 may trigger
# (her centre < 2336), but parked or at its stop (right edge 2142) it stays
# left of the screen edge, out of her reach, and it drives away from her.
level  = st_wolfgang
